ocked at how brutal his colleagues  across the country had been  yes  [Music]  but it will take more than a few  defections to tip the balance  with some flamboyance lukashenko has put  the army on high alert supposedly he  claims to protect against nato and the  west  that is as much a warning to his  domestic audience as it is the mark of a  paranoid mind  the president clearly trying to turn the  hatred of his own people towards him  into a geopolitical issue which  it patently is not with so much force  and the apparatus of the state still at  his disposal  it is difficult to see where this  protest movement goes  the clamor from the street that  lukashenka leave for now  falling on deaf ears danny magne sky  news  minsk

